    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abiya yaafa, yeeyimba ku badhaadha be abaafa, yaaziikibwa mu kyetebwa Ekibuga kya Daudi. Mutabane we Asa yaamusikira ku bwakyabazinga. Mu biseera bya Asa oyo, ensi yaaba mu miraala okumala entangama ya myaka ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa yaasiimya Musengwa Katonda we, olw'ebirungi n'ebituufu bye yakola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaatoolagho alutaari edh'abamaghanga agandi n'ebifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, yaamenhamenhagho empango edh'amabaale, era yaatemagho n'ebifaananie bya Ashera, omusambwa gwaibwe omukazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaalagira abantu b'omu Buyudaaya okukolanga ebyo Musengwa Katonda, oyo Katonda wa badhaadha baibwe by'ayenda, n'okugemanga amateeka ge n'ebiragiro bye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era yaatoola mu bibuga byonabyona ebya Buyudaaya, ebifo ebigulumivu eby'okusinzizaamu, ni alutaari edh'okuniokezaaku obubbaani. Kale, mu biseera bye, obwakyabazinga bwe bwaba mu miraala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaazimba mu Buyudaaya ebibuga ebyezungulwirwa ebimante ebigumu, kuba ensi yali mu miraala. Mu myaka egyo, Asa tiyali na ntalo, kuba Musengwa Katonda yamugha okuba emiraala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaakoba abantu b'omu Buyudaaya ati: “Ka tuzimbe ebibuga bino, tubyezunguluzeeku n'ebimante ebigumu, tubizimbeku n'ebituuti ebirengererwaku, era tubiteeku n'endhigi edhiriku ebisiba munda. Ensi eno ekaali yaife, kuba twakola Musengwa Katonda waife by'ayenda. Twakola by'ayenda kyeyava n'atugha emiraala ku ndhuyi dhaife dhoonadhoona.” Kale baazimba, era ebintu byabajiiranga bukalamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga Asa yali n'eigye ly'abalwani emitwalo amakumi asatu (300,000) abaava mu kika kya Yuda, abaalwanisanga engabo n'amafumo. Era yaaba n'abalwani emitwalo abiri na munaana (280,000) abaava mu kika kya Benjamini, abaalwanisanga engabo n'obulaso. Abo boonaboona baali balwani ba maani abaziramu ntete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ghaabaagho Omwethiopia ayetebwa Zera, yaabalumba n'eigye lya balwani akakaire kalamba (1,000,000), n'ebigaali eby'omu lutalo ebikumi bisatu. Yaidha yaatuukira irala e Maresha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa yaaja okumulwanisa. Endhuyi dhombi dhaasimbya abalwani baadho enhiriri mu kiiko ky'e Zefatha okumpi n'e Maresha, baalingagana nga beetegeike okulwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa yaasaba Musengwa Katonda we ng'akoba ati: “Wo Musengwa Katonda, ezirayo ali ng'oti niiwe mu kuyamba abanafu n'ab'amaani. Wo Musengwa Katonda waife, tuyambe ife, kuba niiwe ye twesiga era twidhie mu liina lyo okulwanisa eigye lino einene liti. Wo Musengwa Katonda, niiwe Katonda waife. Otaikiriza muntu kukughangula naire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Musengwa Katonda yaaghangula Abaethiopia mu maiso ga Asa n'ag'Abayudaaya. Abaethiopia baalumuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asa n'abantu be yali nabo baababingirira okutuuka e Gerari. Abaethiopia kamaala inho baitibwa, eigye lyaibwe nga tirikaasobola kwesoloza ghalala kulwana, kuba Musengwa Katonda yabaghangula yaabamala amaani n'eigye lye. Abayudaaya baatwala omunhago mungi inho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baazikiriza ebibuga byonabyona ebyetooloire Gerari, kuba abantu baayo Musengwa Katonda yabaleetera okutya. Baanhagulula ebibuga ebyo byonabyona, kuba byalimu ebintu kamaala eby'okunhaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era baalumba ni weema edh'abaayi, baanhaga entaama n'engamiya kamaala inho. Bwe baamala, bairayo e Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
